{
  "slug": "product-dev-agent",
  "name": "Product Dev Agent",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "An opinionated product-development loop: a planning model designs the work, an implementation model executes it via outside-in BDD + unit TDD, with a 3-pass critical review on both the plan and the code, and a Keep/Change/Try retrospective that folds learnings back into the rules.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `bootstrap` (Install product-dev-agent's templates and CLAUDE.md snippet into a consuming project), `implement` (Phase 3 of the product-dev-agent loop), `maintenance` (The product-dev-agent maintenance sub-loop), `plan-story` (Phase 1 of the product-dev-agent loop), `retro` (Phase 5 of the product-dev-agent loop), `review-impl` (Phase 4 of the product-dev-agent loop), `review-plan` (Phase 2 of the product-dev-agent loop)\n- **Agents** (1): `sonnet-implementer` (Execute a planned story via outside-in BDD + unit TDD)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install product-dev-agent@claude-community` from `xavierbriand/product-dev-agent`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1
  },
